description "Jan Ors 

An ultrafast gunner who sets the pace of engagements and blows away her enemies with a chunky shrapnel launcher.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Lightweight
- DH-17 Blaster Pistol (Blaster Rifle 2)
-- 10% faster RoF
-- 10% faster reload
- FC-1 Flechette Launcher (2)
-- 15% more damage/FP damage
-- Flechette Grenades (10/3)
- 3 Frag Grenades

^6Inventory:
- Advanced Medpac ^3[CS4]
- Assault Sentry

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- 10% faster hacking
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

After receiving additional intel of a spare Battalion of Dark Troopers stationed on Gall and learning about Kyle's involvement in the Rescue of Han Solo, Jan Ors wasted no time in joining General Calrissian & Dash Rendar's strike team."